hev\",\"United Nations General Assembly\",\"lunar orbit rendezvous\",\"direct ascent\",\"Earth orbit rendezvous\",\"James Webb\",\"Apollo\",\"Project Gemini\",\"command module (CM)\",\"service module (SM)\",\"lunar module (LM)\",\"Interplanetary Monitoring Platform (IMP)\",\"Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC)\",\"Gus Grissom\",\"Ed White\",\"Roger B. Chaffee\",\"Apollo 7\",\"Apollo 8\",\"Apollo 9\",\"Apollo 10\"],\"findingCount\":9}}","seal":"9ff0a5ab7e71051ad2de6cfe1257f007d598a93e3d55bf442616f6e247f18d04"}}

